\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s12}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s13}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s14}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s15}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s16}}</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"Overview"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Detecting and stopping threats in real time"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Modern attacks move fast, often outside working hours. Prevention alone isn’t enough, you need to detect and respond quickly when something gets through."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"WhizzIT’s MDR combines advanced tooling with expert analysis to detect threats across your endpoints and cloud and respond rapidly to contain them."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Detection and response covers your endpoints, Microsoft 365 identities, servers and cloud, with containment happening first so a problem stops spreading while it is investigated. Everything runs through the same UK service desk that handles your day-to-day tickets, so there is no separate team to chase. Across 2025 our average first response time was 9 minutes and our average resolution time was 6 hours, measured across every ticket we handled. We are a team of five engineers supporting more than 30 UK businesses, from two-user teams to organisations of 150+ users."},{"k":"u5","type":"u","label":"Link: Back to Cyber Security","default":"/cyber-security/"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"Back to Cyber Security"},{"k":"i7","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-detection-response-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-detection-response-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-detection-response-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-detection-response-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Analyst concentrating on multiple monitors at her desk in an office\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-detection-response-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Managed Detection & Response"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"What’s included"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Continuous threat detection"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Endpoint and cloud coverage"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Rapid response and containment"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Expert-led investigation"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Threat intelligence built in"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Clear reporting and guidance"}]}